    "b-70-save-points-runs-target-claims-wor-22": {
      "id": "b-70-save-points-runs-target-claims-wor-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Runs, target claims, worker states, checkpoints, and report artifacts continue\nto key off the active run internally; each save point records the run that was\nactive when it was taken. The local change ledger (carry-forward patches, facts,\nlessons) flows across save points the same way it flows across sessions: only\nshipped PR candidates leave the system. Reverting to a save point is git-native\n— the commit, its reports, and the board state in the same state directory\ntravel together."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
